    2. Spring Security 6.5.0 is the version managed by Spring Boot 3.5.0
       BOM; no patched 6.5.x release is available at time of review.
    3. All JWT validation is performed via Keycloak's JWKS endpoint; no
       external introspection endpoint is configured.
    Reviewed 2026-04-24 by RazorMVP.
  -->
  <suppress>
    <notes>
      CVE-2026-22732 (CVSS 9.1) — Spring Security 6.5.0 token introspection.
      Application uses JWT (not opaque token introspection); the vulnerable
      OpaqueTokenIntrospector path is never configured. No patched 6.5.x
      release available. Reviewed 2026-04-24.
    </notes>
    <packageUrl regex="true">^pkg:maven/org\.springframework\.security/.*@6\.5\.0$</packageUrl>
